{"thread":{"threadID":3571,"boardID":97,"topic":"Neue Verlosung! 15.05-01.06","time":1463325406,"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","lastPostTime":1464967761,"lastPoster":"BlackFire","replies":17,"views":1137,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":3},"tags":[{"tagID":810,"name":"#rich as fuck"},{"tagID":808,"name":"der boy ist money am getten"},{"tagID":811,"name":"der boy ist nicee"}],"posts":[{"postID":47129,"threadID":3571,"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","subject":"Neue Verlosung! 15.05-01.06","time":1463325406,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","time":1463326216,"value":1},{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1463332640,"value":1},{"userID":2079,"username":"KeinAdmin Brillenträger","time":1463422148,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Was kann man gewinnen, wieso und wie kann man das gewinnen?!<br>Und wieso verlose ich immer wieder eine Psc.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ganz einfach, ich bin geil <span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Zu verlosen gibt es eine 10 Euro psc Karte die am 01.06.2016, der Gewinner erhalten wird. Je nach Gewinner werde ich nochmal was dazu legen (20-30)!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Diesmal könnt IHR, die Community entscheiden wer gewinnt. Jeder der teilnehmen will muss das Wort &quot;Salami&quot; in einem Satz verwenden. Wer die meisten Likes hat gewinnt. ihr könnt alles disliken und liken was ihr wollt. Also denkt euch was aus und sprengt die likes <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wer mehrer Sätze mit &quot;salami&quot; schreibt wird von allen anderen gewinnspielen ausgeschlossen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Hoffe euch gefallen meine ideen, ihr könntet mir auch eigene ideen gerne schreiben</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich wünsche euch viel spaß und viel glück <span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Viel Glück und Spaß!!11elf!!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47132,"threadID":3571,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1463326726,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":6,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","time":1463328320,"value":1},{"userID":2079,"username":"KeinAdmin Brillenträger","time":1463328830,"value":1},{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1463329591,"value":1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1463329660,"value":1},{"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","time":1463337640,"value":1},{"userID":2101,"username":"Hypnoxas","time":1463338737,"value":1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1463929805,"value":1},{"userID":1904,"username":"MaDNeZ","time":1464383810,"value":1},{"userID":1292,"username":"Stabiler Lyssop","time":1463426126,"value":-1},{"userID":2064,"username":"Gammly","time":1463950473,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Kinder in Afrika sind am Verhungern! Und du tust rein gar nichts dagegen!<br>Deswegen habe ich mir es als Aufgabe genommen, die Kinder in Afrika zu ernähren. Für jeden Like spende ich etwas nach Afrika zu Essen!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Also: 1 Like = 1 Salami</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Danke, ihr macht die Welt dadurch zu einem besseren Ort  <span class=\"missing-media\">[^^]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>PS: <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a>, ein Raffletag wäre jetzt in Betracht zu ziehen, dies ist nun seine 4te Verlosung, bei denen er die Preise auch auszahlt.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47138,"threadID":3571,"userID":null,"username":"Kain","subject":"","time":1463331850,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1463335025,"value":1},{"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","time":1463335521,"value":1},{"userID":2079,"username":"KeinAdmin Brillenträger","time":1463505249,"value":1},{"userID":1292,"username":"Stabiler Lyssop","time":1463426165,"value":-1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1463426172,"value":-1},{"userID":2064,"username":"Gammly","time":1463950469,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Salami ist Haram außer es ist Geflügel</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47149,"threadID":3571,"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","subject":"","time":1463336826,"lastEditTime":1463769567,"editCount":3,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":5,"editorID":1791,"editor":"Pixel","likes":[{"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","time":1463353182,"value":1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1463380302,"value":1},{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1463402492,"value":1},{"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","time":1463408795,"value":1},{"userID":2079,"username":"KeinAdmin Brillenträger","time":1463505246,"value":1},{"userID":2087,"username":"Flexutaki","time":1463677911,"value":1},{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1463768036,"value":1},{"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","time":1464359557,"value":1},{"userID":1292,"username":"Stabiler Lyssop","time":1463426171,"value":-1},{"userID":2064,"username":"Gammly","time":1464297724,"value":-1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1464815454,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Nachtfrische</strong></cite><p>Kinder in Afrika sind am Verhungern!<br></p></blockquote><p><br>GENAU!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Diese PSCs die du die ganze Zeit verlost hätten HUNGERNDE KINDER in Afrika noch essen können! Nicht jeder Mensch auf der Welt kann sich jeden Tag eine Hunger stillende Brotauflage leisten, Mister YellowSalamichild</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span> </p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47188,"threadID":3571,"us